        "Recycled Paper"@en,
        "Papel Reciclado"@es,
        "रीसाइकल्ड काग़ज़"@hi,
        "再生紙（コートまたは非コート）"@ja,
        "Resirkulert papir"@nb,
        "Gerecycled papier"@nl,
        "Papier makulaturowy"@pl,
        "Papel reciclado"@pt,
        "Returpapper"@sv,
        "再生纸"@zh-Hans ;
    ptpge:deprecatedOn "2026-09-23"^^xsd:date ;
    ptpge:deprecationReason "Recycled is a fibre origin, not a surface: a recycled paper has a surface of its own (matte, silk …), so it moved to the new facet paper-fibre (recycled-fibre). Product envelopes now carry supportsSubstrateFibre instead."@en,
        "Resirkulert er fiberopphav, ikke overflate: et resirkulert papir har sin egen overflate (matt, silk …), så verdien er flyttet til den nye fasetten paper-fibre (recycled-fibre). Produktmalene bærer nå supportsSubstrateFibre i stedet."@nb ;
    ptpge:elementType "value" ;
    ptpge:group "substrates" ;
    ptpge:level "element" ;
